  {
    "id": 3924311107,
    "type": "DiffNote",
    "body": "D6 defines abandoned as having no conscious character aboard, but `POS_SLEEPING` is numerically above `POS_STUNNED`, so a sleeping player or mobile makes this return false. For a stopped ship at sea whose only occupant is asleep, `claimship` and `plunder` reject the abandoned-prize condition even though the ship meets D6. The bridge contest checks in `do_claimship()` and `do_plunder()` use the same threshold, so they also need to allow an unconscious sleeper for this case.",
    "author": {
      "id": 42759441,
      "username": "max757",
      "public_email": "",
      "name": "Max aka Mosheh",
      "state": "active",
      "locked": false,
      "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3c7c169343bd7d0f4575137ce8065aee7cb44024d447bbfe66d773133a81c43e?s=80&d=identicon",
