  {
    "id": 3924322400,
    "type": "DiffNote",
    "body": "S3 3.3.3 says a failed knockdown save leaves the occupant prone for two rounds, but this sets `POS_SITTING`. The game has `POS_RECLINING` for prone, and `fight.c` applies a different position penalty (-3 circumstance and -3 AC instead of the sitting penalty). A sailor who fails this save is only sitting during the two-round wait, so attacks against them use the wrong combat state. The new CuTest also asserts the sitting state, so it currently locks in the gap.",
    "author": {
      "id": 42759441,
      "username": "max757",
      "public_email": "",
      "name": "Max aka Mosheh",
      "state": "active",
