    "id": 3924604899,
    "type": null,
    "body": "added 6 commits\n\n<ul><li>55d88302 - Stop a hull dead when she is holed or starts sinking</li><li>05b40a93 - Keep a sinking hull&#39;s sink timer across a restart</li><li>48d69e6a - Let a sleeper neither defend a prize nor hold her bridge</li><li>390fd54f - Knock sailors prone, not sitting, when a hit shakes the hull</li><li>02729c19 - Record the MR !8 review fixes</li><li>d98ee1b1 - Record the MR !8 review-round CI results</li></ul>\n\n[Compare with previous version](/max757/Luminari-Source/-/merge_requests/8/diffs?diff_id=2062576803&start_sha=ec197b3fee4ba75edd5cbd510aa497641618f0ed)",
